        "TileImage": "$($repository 4601f70d-be0e-461b-8b54-2e2ac483b72f).Image",
        "Description": "Good evning 47. \rYour target is Lena Bjeornshauge, the new CEO of &apos;Kronstadt Industries&apos;. After the death of Robert Knox, she quickly retook the company for &apos;Providence&apos;. Having joined Arthur Edwards new form of &apos;Providence&apos;, Lena has now become one of the new partners. \rWe have to prevent &apos;Providence&apos; from forming in its old glory, making Lena Bjoernshauge a target. \rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages. \rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare. \rMission status: ACTIVE",
